<body>
  <header>
    <div class='logo'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
      <a href='conditions.html' style='color:#111;font-weight:700'>Conditions</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class='wrap'>
    <h1>Conditions we often support</h1>
    <div class='intro'>Educational support and integrative approaches tailored to the whole person. Not a substitute for medical care; see full disclaimer below.</div>

    <div class='grid'>
      <section>
        <div class='card'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Digestive & Metabolic Patterns</div>
          <div class='condition'>Irritable bowel symptoms, functional bloating, postprandial discomfort. We emphasize diet experiments, sleep and stress rhythm work.</div>
          <div class='condition'>Blood sugar variability, fatigue after meals. Coaching focuses on patterns and small actionable tests you can try safely.</div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Sleep & Energy Dysregulation</div>
          <div class='condition'>Trouble falling asleep, fragmented nights, low daytime energy. We layer behavioral strategies, light and timing adjustments, and pacing.</div>
          <div class='support'>If you have signs of a sleep disorder (apnea, narcolepsy), we will refer to a sleep clinic for diagnostics.</div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Chronic Stress, Mood, & Resilience</div>
          <div class='condition'>Persistent worry, low mood, or brain fog linked to long-term stress. We use short experiments and skills to restore baseline functioning.</div>
          <div class='support'>We do not provide emergency psychiatric services; if you are in crisis, please contact local emergency resources immediately.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Important disclaimer</div>
          <div class='disclaimer'>This site provides general educational information about integrative approaches. It is not medical advice and does not replace evaluation by a licensed healthcare provider. If you have a serious or life-threatening condition, seek immediate medical care.</div>
          <div class='help'>If you are under medical treatment, we work collaboratively with your care team when appropriate. All program participation is voluntary and informed consent is obtained.</div>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>When to reach out</div>
          <ul style='color:#374151;font-size:14px'>
            <li>New or worsening symptoms (fever, severe pain, unintentional weight loss) — seek medical care.</li>
            <li>Concerns about medication changes — coordinate with prescribing clinician before altering doses.</li>
            <li>Questions about program suitability — book a consult.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class='card' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Evidence & reporting</div>
          <div style='color:#6b7280;font-size:13px'>We collect anonymized outcomes and produce plain-language case notes and summaries. Our materials aim to be transparent about uncertainty and limits.</div>
          <div class='proof-badges'>
            <div class='badge' data-tip='Peer-reviewed case notes'>Case Notes</div>
            <div class='badge' data-tip='Small trials and pilot work'>Pilot Data</div>
            <div class='badge' data-tip='Provider-facing trainings'>Clinician Guides</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style='margin-top:18px'>
      <div class='card'>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>Not sure where to start?</div>
        <div style='color:#6b7280;margin-top:8px'>We offer a short orientation call to map your context and recommend one of our cohort paths or an individualized plan. Book a brief consult to see which approach fits your time and goals.</div>
        <div style='margin-top:12px'><a href='book.html' style='background:#6c63ff;color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700'>Book a quick consult</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style='padding:18px'>Contact: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> • Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
  </footer>

</body>
